** sch_path: design/column/column.sch

* one I/O column, mux 2: two bit-line pairs of 128 cells (7 row + 1 column address bits).


* WL = the selected row (both pairs), WLU = the other 127 rows (shared net, held low).


* XU cells of a pair share one Q/QB node pair UQ/UQB: 127 identical cells, same state.

